WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.380 --> 00:07.100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage depicted in this series]

3
00:07.210 --> 00:08.211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:08.240 --> 00:09.421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference for traditional Thai massage.]

5
00:09.500 --> 00:10.901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate any of the techniques shown,]

6
00:11.000 --> 00:12.001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

7
00:12.030 --> 00:13.161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

8
00:13.170 --> 00:14.900
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

9
00:15.072 --> 00:16.720
That massage therapist drugged you.

10
00:16.939 --> 00:18.540
I should've killed her.

11
00:18.854 --> 00:21.280
She wasn't trying to seriously hurt you.

12
00:21.430 --> 00:22.600
She's just keeping you from fully recovering

13
00:22.880 --> 00:24.235
so you'll call her back for another massage.

14
00:24.310 --> 00:27.640
Tell that fucking massage therapist to come massage me again in three days.

15
00:27.926 --> 00:30.400
Has Hattha ever gone through any of my storage boxes?

16
00:30.650 --> 00:34.051
She asked me for the key so she could look for a herbal compress recipe.

17
00:34.288 --> 00:35.920
Please don't let it be what I think it is.

18
00:38.704 --> 00:40.705
You're going to die by my hand, Dongyang.

19
00:42.611 --> 00:44.240
This is your father's massage shop, isn't it?

20
00:44.612 --> 00:46.173
Don't worry. Dongyang doesn't know.

21
00:46.200 --> 00:47.920
This place is more dangerous than you think.

22
00:48.990 --> 00:50.291
Get in the van. Mr. Dongyang is waiting.

23
00:51.043 --> 00:53.400
Hello, Mr. Krit.

24
00:53.472 --> 00:55.600
I'm Hattha. Do you remember me?

25
00:55.739 --> 00:57.040
Ah, the one in Phuket, right?

26
00:57.131 --> 00:59.600
- Yes. - I should get going.

27
00:59.680 --> 01:01.400
Of course. Goodbye.

28
01:01.848 --> 01:03.160
Only the hostesses are going on the boat?

29
01:03.192 --> 01:04.440
Can I go massage Mr. Dongyang now?

30
01:04.696 --> 01:05.806
He only asked for the hostesses.

31
01:05.806 --> 01:07.207
Li, are you in Pattaya?

32
01:07.283 --> 01:09.120
If I can't find a replacement for tonight,

33
01:09.155 --> 01:10.456
we're all totally screwed.

34
02:19.459 --> 02:21.080
Are you looking for someone to take your place on the boat?

35
02:21.598 --> 02:23.160
I can take your place. I won't even charge you.

36
02:24.619 --> 02:26.180
But you have to do something for me.

37
02:37.326 --> 02:38.760
Open the room for me. I'm going to take a nap.

38
02:56.003 --> 02:58.160
Oh, I ordered some food. It should be here soon.

39
02:59.486 --> 03:01.331
Hey, what are you doing?

40
03:02.200 --> 03:03.201
I'm going to take a nap.

41
03:06.251 --> 03:07.252
Give me that.

42
04:01.758 --> 04:03.120
All right, go.

43
04:03.155 --> 04:04.250
Just go inside.

44
04:04.464 --> 04:06.165
- Go! - Hurry up!

45
04:06.665 --> 04:07.666
Let's go.

46
04:08.166 --> 04:09.320
Come on.

47
04:39.398 --> 04:40.399
Dongyang.

48
04:42.320 --> 04:44.800
You told me he would clear the route

49
04:44.880 --> 04:47.081
from the border to Samut Prakan.

50
04:47.328 --> 04:50.496
I didn't pay a million dollar for him to sit around,

51
04:50.838 --> 04:52.864
making empty promises.

52
04:54.208 --> 04:58.840
That's why I brought everyone together today, Singh.

53
04:59.736 --> 05:02.320
All my men were busted at the checkpoint.

54
05:02.387 --> 05:05.120
My entire logistics network is ruined.

55
05:05.534 --> 05:06.535
I know.

56
05:06.712 --> 05:10.640
But let's wait and hear what he has to say, okay?

57
05:13.507 --> 05:16.180
Speak of the damn devil, here he comes.

58
05:56.392 --> 05:57.920
Your police are announcing

59
05:57.987 --> 06:00.880
they are going to expose our whole operation.

60
06:01.112 --> 06:02.200
What'd they have to say?

61
06:03.880 --> 06:05.920
They're just doing what they're told.

62
06:06.040 --> 06:07.080
It's all scripted.

63
06:08.611 --> 06:11.100
What about my men who got arrested?

64
06:11.395 --> 06:15.411
I've already set up a scapegoat for the police to close the case.

65
06:15.486 --> 06:16.487
Okay?

66
06:17.907 --> 06:18.908
Clear?

67
06:20.659 --> 06:21.880
I need to talk to you.

68
06:22.060 --> 06:23.161
I need to talk to you, too.

69
06:25.507 --> 06:26.508
Enjoy.

70
06:34.824 --> 06:36.040
Hey, get out.

71
06:36.691 --> 06:37.692
All of you, out!

72
06:39.692 --> 06:40.693
Get out.

73
06:48.238 --> 06:51.640
You think saying that is enough to make this all go away?

74
06:53.843 --> 06:57.080
I warned you. The DSI's been watching you closely lately.

75
06:58.000 --> 07:00.118
I told you to lie low, but you wouldn't listen.

76
07:00.630 --> 07:03.504
So what? You can take my business elsewhere. I don't care.

77
07:05.448 --> 07:08.000
But when it comes to money laundering or human trafficking,

78
07:08.259 --> 07:10.670
if you use my name, no one else will bother you.

79
07:11.608 --> 07:12.609
Want to test that?

80
07:16.166 --> 07:17.167
Are you threatening me?

81
07:20.480 --> 07:23.800
I'm warning you because we've known each other a long time.

82
07:25.275 --> 07:28.520
This really isn't the time to be making more enemies.

83
07:29.276 --> 07:30.720
You've already got so many,

84
07:32.128 --> 07:35.129
you're practically tripping over them.

85
07:35.350 --> 07:36.920
What the hell are you talking about?

86
07:37.536 --> 07:41.894
Hey, I ran into a girl named Hattha at the hotel earlier.

87
07:43.531 --> 07:44.840
The massage therapist's daughter.

88
07:44.890 --> 07:47.500
The one whose shop you burned down in Phuket years ago.

89
07:48.894 --> 07:50.960
She said she was waiting to give a client a massage.

90
07:51.299 --> 07:53.720
Hey, don't tell me you're the client.

91
08:04.100 --> 08:05.501
Did you hit another sen line again?

92
08:12.904 --> 08:14.605
That massage therapist drugged you.

93
08:15.280 --> 08:18.400
That bitch! I should've killed her.

94
08:18.966 --> 08:21.360
She wasn't trying to seriously hurt you.

95
08:21.744 --> 08:22.760
She's just keeping you from fully recovering

96
08:23.120 --> 08:24.521
so you'll call her back for another massage.

97
08:24.643 --> 08:26.120
What kind of fucking massage therapist keeps her customers sick?

98
08:46.203 --> 08:48.640
Bring that damn massage therapist onto the boat. Now.

99
09:10.208 --> 09:11.209
Okay.

100
09:18.664 --> 09:19.690
The boss is calling for you.

101
09:23.806 --> 09:24.807
Did you hear me?

102
09:37.974 --> 09:39.451
Hey, wake up.

103
09:44.243 --> 09:45.320
How the hell did you get here?

104
09:46.766 --> 09:47.920
Where's Hattha?

105
09:57.531 --> 09:58.532
Wait.

106
09:58.966 --> 10:00.000
Room service.

107
10:03.750 --> 10:04.751
Come in.

108
10:14.763 --> 10:15.880
Everything okay?

109
10:16.011 --> 10:18.240
Why are those guys guarding the door?

110
10:18.680 --> 10:20.681
It's nothing. Come here.

111
10:23.200 --> 10:24.320
I'll explain everything.

112
10:24.854 --> 10:27.360
The thing is... it's...

113
10:27.840 --> 10:29.200
Oh, your shoulders are pretty stiff.

114
10:29.680 --> 10:32.800
It's nothing. They just hired them to stand guard.

115
10:32.848 --> 10:35.480
Back home, it's like... you know, like...

116
10:36.851 --> 10:39.520
Your shoulders are really tense. Have you been stressed?

117
10:45.052 --> 10:46.053
Does that feel good?

118
10:47.259 --> 10:48.560
I'm pretty good at massages.

119
11:06.387 --> 11:07.388
14…

120
11:08.080 --> 11:09.120
15…

121
11:15.774 --> 11:17.120
She's been moved to the room.

122
11:26.467 --> 11:29.360
Phat, that damn Hattha escaped onto the boat.

123
11:46.350 --> 11:47.651
All right, go.

124
11:47.710 --> 11:48.840
Just go inside.

125
11:48.963 --> 11:50.880
- Go! - Hurry up!

126
11:51.187 --> 11:52.188
Let's go.

127
11:52.702 --> 11:53.800
Come on.

128
12:23.600 --> 12:24.601
[Mr. Dongyang]

129
12:26.230 --> 12:27.920
Is that massage therapist on the boat yet?

130
12:29.100 --> 12:30.101
Mr. Dongyang.

131
12:30.648 --> 12:33.000
That massage therapist, Hattha, disguised herself as an escort and got on the boat.

132
12:34.830 --> 12:35.831
Yes.

133
13:15.784 --> 13:16.785
What are you going to do?

134
13:18.360 --> 13:19.361
That's my business.

135
13:47.982 --> 13:49.000
What's your plan?

136
13:49.822 --> 13:51.480
I never do anything without expecting something in return.

137
13:56.755 --> 13:57.756
14…

138
13:59.875 --> 14:00.876
15…

139
14:58.595 --> 14:59.596
What are you waiting for?

140
16:31.488 --> 16:34.100
The last step of the deadly massage.

141
16:34.640 --> 16:35.720
The pressure point on the neck.

142
16:36.100 --> 16:38.120
Apply light pressure for 15 seconds.

143
16:38.360 --> 16:39.560
The target will begin to lose consciousness.

144
16:40.118 --> 16:43.600
Keep applying pressure for another 45 seconds.

145
16:43.880 --> 16:45.960
The result is death.

146
16:48.800 --> 16:49.801
One…

147
16:51.483 --> 16:52.484
Two…

148
16:54.680 --> 16:55.681
Three…

149
16:57.414 --> 16:58.415
Four…

150
17:00.486 --> 17:01.487
Five…

151
17:03.059 --> 17:04.060
Six…

152
17:05.598 --> 17:06.599
Seven…

153
17:08.126 --> 17:09.127
Eight…

154
17:10.307 --> 17:11.308
Nine…

155
17:12.880 --> 17:13.881
10…

156
17:15.774 --> 17:16.775
11…

157
17:18.484 --> 17:19.485
12…

158
17:20.968 --> 17:21.969
13…

159
17:24.169 --> 17:25.360
You Phuket brat.

160
17:57.240 --> 17:58.320
You little shit.

161
18:02.300 --> 18:03.301
Get over here.

162
18:03.480 --> 18:05.320
You fucking bitch!

163
18:38.616 --> 18:39.617
One…

164
18:40.568 --> 18:41.569
Two…

165
18:42.569 --> 18:43.570
Three…

166
18:44.619 --> 18:45.620
Four…

167
19:20.987 --> 19:22.240
Go to hell.

168
19:29.440 --> 19:30.480
You little brat!

169
19:40.120 --> 19:41.121
22...

170
19:41.678 --> 19:42.679
23…

171
19:43.427 --> 19:44.428
24…

172
19:44.854 --> 19:45.855
25…

173
19:46.512 --> 19:47.513
26…

174
19:48.283 --> 19:49.284
27…

175
19:49.734 --> 19:50.735
28…

176
19:51.254 --> 19:52.255
29…

177
19:52.486 --> 19:53.487
30…

178
19:54.160 --> 19:55.161
31…

179
19:55.560 --> 19:56.561
32…

180
19:57.080 --> 19:58.081
33…

181
19:58.381 --> 19:59.382
34…

182
20:00.131 --> 20:01.132
35…

183
20:01.742 --> 20:02.743
36…

184
20:03.300 --> 20:04.301
37…

185
20:04.856 --> 20:05.857
38…

186
20:11.086 --> 20:12.187
42….

187
20:12.560 --> 20:13.920
- Mr. Dongyang. - 43…

188
20:14.561 --> 20:15.562
44…

189
20:21.296 --> 20:23.456
Mr. Dongyan! Mr. Dongyang!

190
20:35.654 --> 20:37.280
- Go get the AED! - Okay.

191
21:23.254 --> 21:25.822
- Hey, I'm taking the girls back. - Sure.

192
21:28.800 --> 21:29.840
You all can leave now.

193
22:32.763 --> 22:33.764
We need to talk.

194
22:39.696 --> 22:41.480
Give up on getting revenge on Dongyang.

195
22:41.480 --> 22:44.075
Death isn't the answer to everything.

196
22:44.315 --> 22:45.316
Trust me.

197
22:46.116 --> 22:47.520
He deserves to die.

198
22:48.640 --> 22:51.440
Once you kill someone, you'll never sleep soundly again.

199
22:52.595 --> 22:54.250
You have a father who loves you and is waiting for you.

200
22:54.755 --> 22:56.100
Go back and live your life with him.

201
22:58.800 --> 23:01.240
Some people would give anything to have that chance, but they don't.

202
23:04.291 --> 23:06.150
He killed my mother and my brother.

203
23:06.334 --> 23:08.200
And he left my father disabled.

204
23:08.270 --> 23:10.360
If I can't kill him, I'm the one who'll never sleep soundly again.

205
23:12.731 --> 23:14.352
You were going to kill Dongyang with massage, weren't you?

206
23:17.800 --> 23:19.601
Like when you kissed me and knocked me out?

207
23:20.856 --> 23:21.857
Don't be ridiculous.

208
23:22.707 --> 23:24.400
Have you ever kissed a woman, Mr. Bodyguard?

209
23:34.046 --> 23:35.047
You didn't pass out.

210
23:41.528 --> 23:43.130
You can't beat us.

211
23:53.971 --> 23:56.000
Okay, I'll be right there.

212
24:02.875 --> 24:04.280
Mr. Dongyang is safe.

213
24:55.995 --> 24:57.200
What kind of security is this?

214
24:57.590 --> 24:58.960
How could you let this happen?

215
24:59.419 --> 25:00.840
That massage therapist, Hattha, snuck onto the boat.

216
25:01.072 --> 25:03.160
I called Phat, but we barely got there in time.

217
25:04.219 --> 25:05.978
Why would she want to hurt Mr. Dongyang?

218
25:06.918 --> 25:07.919
I don't know.

219
25:08.886 --> 25:11.211
When I went in, I saw Mr. Dongyang on top of her.

220
25:12.224 --> 25:13.225
Then he collapsed.

221
25:18.232 --> 25:20.120
She tried to kill me.

222
25:21.700 --> 25:22.701
How?

223
25:23.500 --> 25:24.501
How?

224
25:25.915 --> 25:27.760
That damn Hattha.

225
25:31.403 --> 25:33.920
She's the daughter of that massage therapist in Phuket.

226
25:35.016 --> 25:36.017
Phuket?

227
25:37.640 --> 25:41.100
She's here to avenge her parents.

228
25:50.478 --> 25:51.479
Phat!

229
25:52.856 --> 25:55.347
Round up her and all her relatives.

230
25:57.902 --> 25:59.720
Bring them to me alive.

231
26:00.798 --> 26:01.799
Muk.

232
26:03.224 --> 26:04.240
Stay here and look after Mr. Dongyang.

233
26:05.406 --> 26:06.407
I'm going with Phat.

234
26:08.300 --> 26:09.301
Yes, Master.

235
26:17.846 --> 26:18.847
Dad!

236
26:20.902 --> 26:21.903
Dad!

237
26:22.358 --> 26:24.440
Dad, please. Don't go back yet. Just a little longer.

238
26:24.459 --> 26:25.800
- I'm so close, Dad. - Close to what?

239
26:27.254 --> 26:28.560
You mean successfully killing someone?

240
26:29.680 --> 26:31.220
How many more people are you going to kill?

241
26:31.718 --> 26:33.880
Dongyang, Flatfoot,

242
26:34.646 --> 26:36.000
and his men too, right?

243
26:37.579 --> 26:38.720
If you kill them,

244
26:39.622 --> 26:41.195
you'll be no different from them.

245
26:44.027 --> 26:45.560
I'm all packed, Uncle. Shall we go?

246
26:46.240 --> 26:47.241
Wan!

247
26:48.000 --> 26:49.900
Do you want to heal people or kill people?

248
26:50.747 --> 26:52.230
If you go any further down this path,

249
26:52.902 --> 26:54.720
there'll be no turning back, Hattha.

250
26:57.683 --> 27:00.027
Using the art of healing massage to kill people...

251
27:01.043 --> 27:02.846
the consequences will come back to haunt you.

252
27:03.971 --> 27:05.920
And you'll become the very kind of person you hate.

253
27:07.540 --> 27:08.880
We're going home. Now.

254
27:15.235 --> 27:16.526
It's because of this journal, isn't it?

255
27:17.683 --> 27:19.560
This is what made you so sure you could do it.

256
27:22.542 --> 27:23.543
- Dad! - Go!

257
27:25.520 --> 27:27.290
Please stay. Wan, come on.

258
27:27.320 --> 27:29.440
- Hattha, go home. - No, stay.

259
27:29.566 --> 27:30.760
Dad! Wan!

260
27:30.936 --> 27:31.937
Wan! Let me go!

261
27:32.100 --> 27:33.960
Dad! Dad!

262
27:38.254 --> 27:39.255
Dad!

263
27:44.600 --> 27:46.771
Hey, it's on fire.

264
27:50.952 --> 27:51.953
Hattha!

265
27:52.206 --> 27:53.207
Hattha!

266
28:05.230 --> 28:07.320
Her hands are blistered. That must hurt.

267
28:08.582 --> 28:10.383
Physical pain is nothing compared to a broken heart.

268
28:14.624 --> 28:15.785
What about the journal?

269
29:00.142 --> 29:01.320
Master Tim is on his way.

270
29:13.459 --> 29:14.920
Who's with Hattha?

271
29:16.302 --> 29:17.840
Her older brother, Wan,

272
29:18.784 --> 29:21.000
her father, and a caretaker.

273
29:22.886 --> 29:23.887
Her real father?

274
29:25.558 --> 29:26.559
I'm not sure.

275
29:28.250 --> 29:29.251
But he's disabled.

276
29:38.334 --> 29:40.526
Isn't he one of Dongyang's men?

277
29:40.686 --> 29:42.600
Then why did he warn us that they're coming to our house?

278
29:42.800 --> 29:44.000
No time for questions. We need to go.

279
29:52.880 --> 29:55.640
Wan, get inside. Hurry! They're here. Go!

280
30:12.379 --> 30:13.650
They might know what we're up to.

281
30:14.315 --> 30:15.316
Check around the house too.

282
30:15.515 --> 30:17.116
Hey, check the back.

283
30:20.516 --> 30:21.517
Go! Go!

284
30:29.526 --> 30:30.527
Wan, what do we do?

285
30:41.091 --> 30:42.240
Uncle, get on my back.

286
30:43.491 --> 30:44.492
Come on, Dad.

287
30:50.176 --> 30:51.979
It's okay. It's okay. Just go!

288
32:45.502 --> 32:46.503
They're not here.

289
32:47.347 --> 32:48.348
Damn it!

290
33:50.392 --> 33:52.574
Master!

291
33:53.315 --> 33:55.000
- You found them? - Yeah.

292
34:01.571 --> 34:02.572
They escaped out the back.

293
34:13.616 --> 34:14.617
Hattha!

294
34:30.411 --> 34:32.840
Ram them. Keep your head down. Trust me.

295
34:51.054 --> 34:52.055
Shoot out their tires!

296
34:53.587 --> 34:54.588
Everybody, get down!

297
34:57.032 --> 34:58.480
Watch out! Move!

298
35:06.220 --> 35:07.440
What the hell are you doing?

299
35:08.021 --> 35:09.160
I told you to shoot the tires!

300
35:34.683 --> 35:36.100
Can you go home with me now?

301
35:37.584 --> 35:38.800
But we made it out alive.

302
35:38.891 --> 35:39.892
Hattha.

303
35:40.534 --> 35:42.400
All clear. We can go now.

304
35:43.526 --> 35:44.840
Drive straight back to Photharam.

305
35:45.165 --> 35:46.166
Yes, sir.

306
35:49.464 --> 35:50.465
Wait.

307
35:51.928 --> 35:53.600
Why did that bodyguard help you?

308
35:55.744 --> 35:56.880
You know him, don't you?

309
36:01.851 --> 36:03.300
Yeah…I guess.

310
36:31.358 --> 36:32.480
Hattha, you bitch.

311
36:33.800 --> 36:36.000
She must've used the deadly massage technique.

312
36:37.726 --> 36:38.727
How did she know it?

313
36:39.960 --> 36:41.100
How did she know?

314
36:45.678 --> 36:47.280
Uncle!

315
36:47.715 --> 36:48.798
Uncle!

316
36:49.374 --> 36:50.720
- Uncle! - What is it?

317
36:51.272 --> 36:52.900
- Be careful. - What is going on?

318
36:52.904 --> 36:54.800
I woke up and Hattha was gone.

319
36:54.905 --> 36:56.480
But she left a note.

320
36:56.880 --> 36:57.881
Let me see.

321
36:59.040 --> 37:01.720
Once everything's taken care of, I'll come back as soon as I can.

322
37:02.174 --> 37:04.702
I promise I'll take good care of myself. —Hattha

323
37:07.798 --> 37:08.799
What's wrong, Korn?

324
37:10.872 --> 37:12.300
I knew this would happen.

325
37:27.328 --> 37:29.718
I'm not lying, Wan.

326
37:29.974 --> 37:32.219
Hattha really didn't come to see me.

327
37:32.250 --> 37:33.640
She didn't call me either.

328
37:35.200 --> 37:36.760
Okay, okay.

329
37:36.990 --> 37:40.700
If Hattha calls me back or I hear anything from her,

330
37:41.006 --> 37:43.007
I'll let you know right away.

331
37:44.280 --> 37:45.281
Okay.

332
37:46.768 --> 37:48.100
Thank you so much.

333
37:48.358 --> 37:49.700
But I won't be staying long.

334
37:50.159 --> 37:51.400
Please don't tell anyone I'm here yet.

335
37:51.800 --> 37:53.320
So what's going on?

336
37:53.635 --> 37:55.520
You showed up out of nowhere in the middle of the night.

337
37:56.520 --> 37:58.300
Is there something I should know?

338
37:59.902 --> 38:00.903
No.

339
38:02.835 --> 38:04.240
Since when did you get so good at lying?

340
38:05.920 --> 38:08.840
Korn! Hi. How have you been?

341
38:09.165 --> 38:10.195
Not too well, actually.

342
38:11.240 --> 38:12.840
- I had a fight with my daughter. - Oh!

343
38:15.464 --> 38:17.400
- Wan. - Yes?

344
38:18.259 --> 38:19.360
Get her back home.

345
38:21.334 --> 38:23.700
- Hattha, go home. - Wan.

346
38:23.838 --> 38:25.500
- Let's go. - Come on.

347
38:27.500 --> 38:28.501
Korn!

348
38:28.520 --> 38:30.521
- What is going on? - Go home!

349
38:31.000 --> 38:32.040
Where are you going?

350
38:32.680 --> 38:34.360
Hattha, go home.

351
38:34.881 --> 38:35.882
Wan!

352
38:36.224 --> 38:37.225
Muk?

353
38:56.300 --> 38:57.301
Korn.

354
38:59.011 --> 39:00.440
I thought you were fucking dead.

355
39:07.275 --> 39:11.000
Thirty-five years. You really thought you could hide from me forever?

356
39:12.134 --> 39:13.360
I trusted you.

357
39:13.584 --> 39:15.640
I had you help me find a deadly massage technique

358
39:15.776 --> 39:17.960
that could kill someone without them even realizing it.

359
39:25.627 --> 39:26.628
Is he dead?

360
39:26.768 --> 39:29.440
No, he's not dead. He's just unconscious.

361
39:30.022 --> 39:31.023
Hey, Tim.

362
39:31.768 --> 39:33.369
I think that's enough. I feel sorry for him.

363
39:33.944 --> 39:35.120
How can we stop now?

364
39:35.800 --> 39:36.920
We still haven't succeeded.

365
39:37.752 --> 39:40.240
We still don't know which pressure point

366
39:40.253 --> 39:41.600
can kill someone without them even realizing it.

367
39:42.910 --> 39:45.500
When he wakes up, you can try another spot.

368
39:46.424 --> 39:47.425
Damn it.

369
40:11.915 --> 40:12.916
The guiding point.

370
40:23.062 --> 40:24.080
The surrounding point.

371
40:29.195 --> 40:30.720
Then this must be...

372
40:36.800 --> 40:38.170
the death point.

373
40:51.120 --> 40:52.440
The final one.

374
40:53.720 --> 40:54.920
The death point.

375
41:01.528 --> 41:04.374
I'm glad you're still alive.

376
41:06.208 --> 41:09.809
I heard about what happened to your family ten years ago.

377
41:11.494 --> 41:12.495
I'm sorry.

378
41:13.024 --> 41:15.414
Thank you. What about you?

379
41:17.419 --> 41:18.420
How have you been?

380
41:19.456 --> 41:20.457
Good.

381
41:22.613 --> 41:23.720
You never came to see me.

382
41:25.248 --> 41:26.249
Well...

383
41:27.616 --> 41:29.180
It's not easy for me to get around.

384
41:32.478 --> 41:33.479
She's your daughter?

385
41:34.910 --> 41:35.930
What a small world.

386
41:36.880 --> 41:39.163
No wonder she's so good. Now I know where she gets it from.

387
41:40.435 --> 41:41.436
Tim

388
41:43.064 --> 41:46.707
If my daughter did anything to offend you,

389
41:47.427 --> 41:49.100
I apologize on her behalf.

390
41:49.875 --> 41:51.000
Please let her go.

391
41:51.995 --> 41:53.160
She's still young and doesn't know any better.

392
41:53.318 --> 41:54.440
Doesn't know any better?

393
41:55.600 --> 41:56.880
Looking like that?

394
41:58.939 --> 41:59.940
She's old enough to have a husband.

395
42:03.200 --> 42:04.840
But you need to teach her better.

396
42:06.502 --> 42:09.776
If you're going to strike a snake, make sure you kill it.

397
42:11.768 --> 42:13.805
Otherwise, it'll come back and bite you.

398
42:15.859 --> 42:17.040
Don't worry.

399
42:17.486 --> 42:20.568
I'll take my daughter back home to the countryside,

400
42:21.278 --> 42:22.654
and we'll never come back here again.

401
42:23.880 --> 42:25.081
I'll be going now, Tim.

402
42:26.819 --> 42:27.840
Wan. Hattha.

403
42:29.582 --> 42:30.583
Hey!

404
42:31.814 --> 42:32.920
Hey! Hey!

405
42:35.120 --> 42:36.920
I can help treat you so you can walk again.

406
42:47.859 --> 42:48.860
- Master? - Master?

407
42:50.060 --> 42:51.061
Are you okay?

408
42:59.419 --> 43:00.420
Hattha.

409
43:02.078 --> 43:03.960
- You need to apologize to him. - Dad.

410
43:04.734 --> 43:06.160
Apologize to him now.

411
43:16.782 --> 43:18.280
- Hattha. - Hey!

412
43:48.224 --> 43:49.622
You went all the way there and found them.

413
43:49.638 --> 43:51.015
How could you just let them go?

414
43:51.366 --> 43:53.500
Are you going to wait until she tries to kill me again?

415
43:54.323 --> 43:56.163
I have something important to discuss with them.

416
43:56.744 --> 43:58.254
That's your business.

417
43:59.276 --> 44:02.080
Any of you who see her,

418
44:02.513 --> 44:03.614
take her out.

419
44:06.747 --> 44:12.360
If any of you find her, bring her to me first.

420
44:14.000 --> 44:15.001
I'll deal with her myself.

421
44:26.120 --> 44:27.121
Don't worry.

422
44:29.571 --> 44:30.840
Your muscles are going to be tight.

423
45:34.659 --> 45:36.640
You followed me all the way here from the hospital.

424
45:36.755 --> 45:38.000
What are you still standing there thinking about?

425
45:40.155 --> 45:42.520
I'm here to collect the massage fee you still owe me.

426
45:48.542 --> 45:50.291
I want to stay here for a while.

427
45:52.803 --> 45:54.611
Until you manage to kill Dongyang?

428
45:56.350 --> 45:58.300
Aren't you afraid I'll turn you over to Dongyang?

429
45:58.351 --> 45:59.352
You wouldn't do that.

430
46:00.352 --> 46:02.360
Otherwise, you wouldn't have helped me so many times.

431
46:06.059 --> 46:07.560
I'm here to ask for your help.

432
46:08.830 --> 46:11.027
My dad wants to take me back to Photharam, but I don't want to go.

433
46:18.792 --> 46:19.793
Fine.

434
46:21.283 --> 46:22.718
But you have to give me a massage first.

435
46:23.242 --> 46:24.360
What's with you?

436
46:24.840 --> 46:26.606
Someone's asking for treatment. Aren't you going to help?

437
46:27.155 --> 46:29.200
- Don't you want to heal people? - It's not the time.

438
46:29.760 --> 46:31.220
Do you choose when to make your move?

439
46:32.758 --> 46:33.920
What about the method?

440
46:34.854 --> 46:35.920
Do you choose that too?

441
46:38.219 --> 46:39.220
What?

442
46:39.734 --> 46:40.735
The massage.

443
46:41.686 --> 46:42.784
You want a deep massage, right?

444
46:45.595 --> 46:46.596
Fine.

445
46:59.544 --> 47:00.880
The Swallow Glides with the Wind.

446
47:11.187 --> 47:12.680
The Lion Bows and Snaps Its Neck.

447
47:24.323 --> 47:25.880
Massage can kill someone, can't it?

448
47:27.798 --> 47:28.799
What?

449
47:32.046 --> 47:33.718
There are vulnerable points on the human body.

450
47:34.774 --> 47:35.775
Press the right one, and you can kill someone.

451
47:36.619 --> 47:38.440
What have you been reading? Or have you been watching too many movies?

452
47:40.448 --> 47:41.960
The Sideways Stretch.

453
47:45.824 --> 47:48.520
If it were that easy, we wouldn't need massage therapists, would we?

454
47:48.806 --> 47:50.700
Every massage therapist knows the body's vulnerable points.

455
47:51.264 --> 47:52.720
They already know to avoid them.

456
47:53.030 --> 47:54.800
And it's not just massage therapists. Even patients know

457
47:55.104 --> 47:56.400
where the body's vulnerable points are.

458
47:56.912 --> 47:58.803
Even if a skilled massage therapist tried to press one,

459
47:59.320 --> 48:01.120
the moment it hurt, the person would pull away.

460
48:02.291 --> 48:03.800
So how could you possibly kill someone with massage?

461
48:05.592 --> 48:06.593
Think about it.

462
48:16.384 --> 48:17.792
The Cobra Sways Its Head.

463
48:20.536 --> 48:22.760
But I saw your hand on Mr. Dongyang's neck.

464
48:24.766 --> 48:26.640
Don't change the subject just to protect your boss.

465
48:27.278 --> 48:28.500
I'm the victim here.

466
48:31.816 --> 48:32.817
Push forward.

467
48:37.934 --> 48:39.340
The Tiger Circles the Cave.

468
49:03.526 --> 49:05.472
If you keep tensing up like this, I can't apply any pressure.

469
49:06.112 --> 49:07.300
No massage is going to fix it.

470
49:56.512 --> 49:57.560
Feel any better?

471
50:17.345 --> 50:18.440
You're stressed, aren't you?

472
50:20.054 --> 50:21.720
Sometimes you need to let things go.

473
50:22.305 --> 50:25.120
It'll help loosen up these tight muscles a little.

474
50:28.592 --> 50:30.450
Sometimes you have to let yourself make mistakes.

475
50:32.955 --> 50:34.480
It's exhausting trying to be good all the time.

476
50:54.024 --> 50:55.920
He killed my mother and my brother.

477
50:56.160 --> 50:57.961
And he left my father disabled.

478
50:58.046 --> 51:00.072
If I can't kill him, I'm the one who'll never sleep soundly again.

479
51:09.155 --> 51:10.942
Do you really want to be a murderer that badly?

480
51:12.174 --> 51:14.600
If I can kill Dongyang, I don't care what I become.

481
51:16.198 --> 51:18.840
Once you do it, you'll never be the same person again.

482
51:21.029 --> 51:22.579
Go home with your father.

483
51:26.600 --> 51:29.801
I refuse to be the same person, consumed by what he did to my family.

484
51:31.000 --> 51:32.041
You wouldn't understand.

485
51:32.224 --> 51:34.320
You have no idea how painful it is to live with that kind of suffering.

486
51:34.926 --> 51:36.200
Why wouldn't I understand?

487
51:50.723 --> 51:51.724
You know what they say.

488
51:54.270 --> 51:55.560
Wounds need to be treated.

489
51:58.318 --> 51:59.454
Leave them untreated, and they become chronic.

490
52:00.158 --> 52:02.293
You and I just have different ways of healing.

491
52:05.899 --> 52:06.900
How are they different?

492
52:07.515 --> 52:09.120
Maybe I can help you.

493
52:09.926 --> 52:10.927
Trust me.

494
52:13.083 --> 52:14.539
Go home with your father.

495
52:17.182 --> 52:18.920
Someone like you isn't cut out for this.

496
52:24.526 --> 52:26.040
Can you help me get close to Dongyang?

497
52:30.000 --> 52:31.710
You can sleep on the couch tonight.

498
52:32.462 --> 52:34.046
I'll get you some clothes.

499
53:22.920 --> 53:24.238
Keep a close eye on Dongyang.

500
53:24.739 --> 53:26.920
I'll let you know when it's time... Dad.

501
55:08.840 --> 55:10.712
Do you want to heal people or kill people?

502
55:11.280 --> 55:12.680
If you go any further down this path,

503
55:12.830 --> 55:14.681
there'll be no turning back, Hattha.

504
55:15.507 --> 55:17.808
Using the art of healing massage to kill people...

505
55:18.291 --> 55:20.100
the consequences will come back to haunt you.

506
55:20.574 --> 55:22.440
And you'll become the very kind of person you hate.

507
55:38.767 --> 55:40.000
What are you doing?

508
56:57.688 --> 56:58.689
He's dead.

509
56:59.523 --> 57:01.320
You can go home to your father now.

510
57:29.091 --> 57:30.226
Dongyang is dead.

511
57:30.439 --> 57:31.960
- It's all over. - No, it's not.

512
57:32.000 --> 57:34.360
You think I'm supposed to be grateful? Do you know how much I've endured,

513
57:34.482 --> 57:36.920
how hard I've trained just so I could kill him with my own hands?

514
57:37.280 --> 57:39.281
I told you, I don't want you to become like me.

515
57:43.968 --> 57:45.280
What's wrong with Master Tim's feet?

516
57:45.560 --> 57:47.520
Master Tim isn't someone you should mess with.

517
57:49.360 --> 57:50.440
Stay away from him.
